# What a guard does when the Prince walks up to him.
#
# Level 2 opens in room 5 facing left, and room 5's left neighbour is room 4,
# which has a guard standing at its left end facing right. So a run to the
# left is all it takes to meet one -- no navigation, nothing to drift.
#
# The Prince then stands still for a long stretch, twice. That is the point:
# with no input at all, whatever happens on screen is the guard's own doing,
# which is what `autocontrol_guard` has to reproduce.
level 2
cycles 400
settle 40
phase - 3
phase l 10
phase - 12
phase l 4
phase - 12
